# Campaign workspace: track prompts, conclusions, scripts, and gate baselines.
# Keep the rest on disk for local handoff; do not commit it.

# Orchestrator session state (IMPROVE_DESIGN.md: gitignore, don't delete)
**/memory.xml
**/memory_archive.md

# Raw harness / HTML output. Summaries live in FINDINGS.md, FEATURES.md, etc.
**/reports/*
!**/reports/.gitignore

# Regenerable feature-trace snapshots
**/snapshots/*.json

# DUT locks and locally built harness binaries
**/locks/
**/bin/

# Git-history dumps from feature-presence campaigns (narratives stay tracked)
features-*/inventory/
features-*/inventory.json

# Personal notes
nicole/
